    "Name": "Burro II CT",
    "Details": "The Burro II Super Heavy Cargo Truck is produced by the Iveco Corporation. The truck is principally used as an all-terrain cargo vehicle, first seeing service in the Chaos March, where its rugged suspension system allows it to able to handle rough terrain found on the worlds of that region. The vehicle's design, after showing promise in the Chaos March, begun further production both in the Free Worlds League and the Capellan Confederation.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Primitive Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Environmental Sealing\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       220     25\n<b>Left</b>         220     25\n<b>Right</b>       220     25\n<b>Rear</b>        220     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      880    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Off Roader</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00>Can Resupply/Repair</color>",
